        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn Solid Cast Iron Grilles</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAcorn cast iron grilles add beauty and character to any room in your home. From old home restoration to new construction, traditional to contemporary, Acorn decorative grilles compliments any style. All Acorn grills are solid cast iron, durable, and crafted with care with careful attention to product design, authenticity. These cast iron grilles are made with the high caliber craftsmanship that has made Acorn the choice of architects, designers and homeowners throughout the world.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Matte Cast Iron Registers:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid cast iron.</li>\r\n<li>Available with screw holes and screws for wall opening or without for floor openings.</li>\r\n<li>Available in 12 size design fit standard 2-1/4\", 4\" and 6\" heading ducts.</li>\r\n<li>Traditional matte black finish.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Available in twelve sizes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant to control the air flow? <a href=\"/products/acorn-cast-iron-registers\">Acorn Cast  Iron Registers with Louver assemblies</a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Acorn Cast Iron Grilles",
                "description": "Acorn Matte Cast Iron Grilles - Acorn cast iron grilles add beauty and character to any room in your home. From old home restoration to new construction, traditional to contemporary, Acorn decorative grilles compliments any style. All Acorn grills are solid cast iron, durable, and crafted with care with careful attention to product design, authenticity. These cast iron grilles are made with the high caliber craftsmanship that has made Acorn the choice of architects, designers and homeowners throughout the world.",
